# Generated by `pnpm data` — the licence texts beside them are committed.
#
# Deliberately anchored to the WORKSPACE root: `data/` lives here and nowhere
# else (docs/plans/wave-zero.md §1). If a path regression ever makes the build
# write `apps/app/data/`, this pattern does NOT match it and `git status` offers
# 35 MB of untracked JSON — which is the loudest cheap alarm available for a
# failure whose other symptom is that everything passes.
/data/*.json
/data/raw/

